<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Furious">>
Aryan: Slum boy, your luck has maxed out and runs out now.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I wish you the best of luck too.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Irritated">>
Aryan: The poor can only come so far slum boy—this is your maximum. From this point onwards, we rich boys rule.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I don't want to comment on that—I'll let my bat do the talking.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Disgusted">>
Aryan: Your bat is broken just like your life, your shoes are embarrassing, your hair is unruly, and you smell like garbage. Don't you dare dream about rubbing shoulders with us.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: 5 coins.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Confused">>
Aryan: What?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: 5 coins.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Skeptical">>
Aryan: Yes thats what your life is worth. Just 5 coins.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: 5 coins.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Serious">>
Aryan: Talking gibberish just like you always do. See you

